    {
      "category": "Armed conflicts and attacks",
      "text": "Israeli settlers kill two Palestinians near Ramallah in the West Bank. One of the victims, identified as a Palestinian-American, was beaten to death whilst the other victim was shot in the chest. ((Reuters))"
    },
