      "text": "Ovidio Guzmán López, son of the former drug lord Joaquín \"El Chapo\" Guzmán, pleads guilty to two counts of drug distribution and two counts of participation in a continuing criminal enterprise. He is expected to cooperate with the U.S. government by providing information on criminal networks. ((Reuters)) ((Chicago Tribune))"
    },
